flowchart TB
  classDef step fill:#E6F4F1,stroke:#00A6A6,color:#17212B,stroke-width:2px
  classDef decision fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#B7791F,color:#17212B,stroke-width:2px
  classDef boundary fill:#FDECEC,stroke:#B42318,color:#17212B,stroke-width:3px
  classDef outcome fill:#EAF7EF,stroke:#16805B,color:#17212B,stroke-width:2px
  A[Incoming message]:::step --> B[Input normalization]:::step --> C[Intent assessment]:::step --> D[Buying-opportunity assessment]:::step --> E[Policy and factual checks]:::step --> F{Escalation decision}:::decision --> G[Proposed response]:::step --> H[Mandatory human review]:::boundary --> I{Approve, revise or reject}:::decision
  I -->|Approve| J[Customer-facing response]:::outcome
  I -->|Revise| G
  I -->|Reject| K[No customer-facing response]:::outcome
  X[Catalogue, pricing, stock, location and policy context only when verified or explicitly planned]:::decision -. context .-> E
  linkStyle default stroke:#123B5D,stroke-width:1.5px